            {
                "entry_id": "866bfc85-8e98-38d8-b6f0-10f2ffe30763",
                "word": "MST",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cba39cd5-2001-4269-8173-21ad7b54c5aa",
                        "entry_id": "866bfc85-8e98-38d8-b6f0-10f2ffe30763",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "MSTs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "405767be-2f9d-3bdb-9839-c764711982b9",
                        "entry_id": "866bfc85-8e98-38d8-b6f0-10f2ffe30763",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A parody fanfic created in this manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3e963cf-ff3b-484d-9ea7-4c3a95bd9d43",
                                "sense_id": "405767be-2f9d-3bdb-9839-c764711982b9",
                                "text": "The commentary in the MSTs may have been nasty and uncalled for; but it was not plagiarism."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3ff59c31-2617-4e8b-ae17-c43e351976e4",
                                "sense_id": "405767be-2f9d-3bdb-9839-c764711982b9",
                                "text": "The only MSTs I've seen (on alt.drwho.creative) have been of perfectly good fan fiction, deliberately cut about to make it look silly (truncating a character's words in the middle to create an^([sic]) non-existent innuendo, for example) - and those were *with* the authors' permission."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "18b84881-7cc6-4dbb-b730-ae1033249d20",
                                "sense_id": "405767be-2f9d-3bdb-9839-c764711982b9",
                                "text": "Goodbye Catherine! Come back soon! We'll all miss your unique style of MSTs! I know i will!! ;_;"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "a895c9f1-94e6-3659-944c-1670f435515d",
                "word": "MST",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
